# Original, unprocessed source photos - only the cropped/compressed assets
# actually used by the app (hero.jpg, hero@2x.jpg, hero@3x.jpg) are tracked.
# Keeping a multi-MB source photo in git history for a 90KB shipped asset
# isn't worth it; this stays on disk for future re-cropping if needed.
assets/images/heroimage/hobbysensaihome.png
